  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Wu Zhan Ping arrives while Wu Zhen Zhu is arguing with Wu Ji and introduces himself as Wu clan’s supreme elder in charge of guidance, tasked to guide Wu Ji along the road of becoming an immortal because she has sufficient cultivation level and merit. He says Wu clan cultivates many paths but is most proficient in wind path, which keeps it at the top of Southern Border’s Gu Immortal world. He lists three high-value true inheritances Wu Yong is taking out to nurture descendants, including a soul path true inheritance tied to Spectral Soul Demon Venerable and the Sheng Tian true inheritance Wu Ji retrieved from Kong Sheng Tian, and he warns her choosing is not child’s play.",
      "chapters": [
        2096
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
