        "char_wu_yong",
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "char_kong_sheng_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Wu Ji still refuses, Wu Zhan Ping says she did not lose, that Kong Ri Tian is only a mortal with Immortal Gu and righteous path Gu Immortals already target him, and that if Wu clan succeeds the true inheritance’s value will rise. He is unhappy that she will not choose one of the three and insists she does not yet know Gu Immortal difficulties.",
      "chapters": [
        2097
      ],
